  "description": "The scripts of the Edit Scripts folder of the xEdit 4.1.5q release, the corpus phase 6 checks: every *.pas of the folder with its line count and whether it builds a VCL form (a grep for TForm or ShowModal), pops up a dialog (a grep for InputQuery or InputBox) or is the declaration-only xEditAPI.pas (marked api). The scripts are in the order xedit script list gives them (the form's list order); the line count counts a last line that has no line break, as reading the file does. Neither flag is a parse, and a script can be both a form and a dialog script.",
